snippet.description:
This is another comparison video between the 17' telescopic vertical and the JPC-12 antennas.  I have both and really enjoy using them.  I wanted to put them on the A/B switch to see how they compared in the real world of POTA activations.  The result was a clear winner, but which antenna took the prize?   Watch to find out.
